(# 2. Working Hours, PTO, and Remote Work) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Working hours:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Core hours are 10:00 to 16:00 in the employee's local time zone, Monday) Tj
0 -14 Td
(through Friday. Teams may agree on a 9-day fortnight only with manager) Tj
0 -14 Td
(approval recorded in Workday.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Paid Time Off \(PTO\) policy:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Full-time employees accrue 15 days of PTO per calendar year, plus 10 paid) Tj
0 -14 Td
(company holidays published on the intranet. Unused PTO may roll over up to) Tj
0 -14 Td
(5 days into the next year. Requests under 3 consecutive days are approved) Tj
0 -14 Td
(by the manager in Workday. Requests of 3 days or more should be submitted) Tj
0 -14 Td
(at least two weeks in advance.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Sick time is separate: 6 days per year. Do not use PTO in place of sick) Tj
0 -14 Td
(time when you are unwell.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Remote work:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Acme Dynamics is hybrid. Employees are expected on-site Tuesday through) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Thursday unless their offer letter says otherwise. Monday and Friday are) Tj
0 -14 Td
(optional work-from-home days. A stable internet connection is required for) Tj
0 -14 Td
(remote days. Remote work is not a substitute for PTO.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Timekeeping:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Non-exempt employees must record hours in Workday daily. Exempt employees) Tj
0 -14 Td
(record exceptions only \(PTO, sick, jury duty\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
